                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/3809: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Geneva</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Gilbert</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Geneva</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-06-08T16:00:00+01:00">June 8, 1934—4
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received June 8—2:25 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>147. Arms embargo proposal. Russia accepts unconditionally.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gilbert</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
